<title>USA: Alcan cut U.S. Nov prices by two cents.</title>
<headline>Alcan cut U.S. Nov prices by two cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium of Canada said its U.S. aluminum ingot and billet transaction prices for November have been cut by two cents per pound to 70 cents and 80 cents respectively from October levels.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
